---
// Clean SVG Architecture Diagram: Dual Lifecycle of Compiled Intent
---

<div class="diagram-container" aria-label="Architecture Diagram: The Dual Lifecycle of Compiled Intent">
  <div class="diagram-header">
    <span class="diagram-badge">System Architecture</span>
    <span class="diagram-title">The Dual Lifecycle: Decoupling Architectural Memory from Code Generation</span>
  </div>

  <div class="svg-wrapper">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 760 270" class="lifecycle-svg" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
      <!-- Background subtle bounds -->
      <!-- Left Box: Shift-Left Proactive Synthesis -->
      <rect x="20" y="55" width="220" height="195" rx="5" fill="none" stroke="var(--border)" stroke-dasharray="4 4" stroke-width="1.2" />
      <text x="35" y="78" class="col-title col-left">Shift-Left: Proactive Synthesis</text>
      <text x="35" y="93" class="col-subtitle">IDE &amp; Local Coding Assistant</text>

      <rect x="35" y="110" width="190" height="42" rx="4" fill="var(--bg)" stroke="var(--border)" stroke-width="1.2" />
      <text x="130" y="127" class="node-title" text-anchor="middle">Developer Prompt</text>
      <text x="130" y="141" class="node-meta" text-anchor="middle">Cursor · Claude Desktop · Windsurf</text>

      <line x1="130" y1="152" x2="130" y2="175" stroke="var(--border)" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#arrow)" />

      <rect x="35" y="175" width="190" height="58" rx="4" fill="var(--bg)" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="1.5" />
      <text x="130" y="196" class="node-title" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--accent)">Compliant Code Generation</text>
      <text x="130" y="210" class="node-meta" text-anchor="middle">Exact types &amp; custom error formats</text>
      <text x="130" y="223" class="node-meta" text-anchor="middle">Zero prompt bloat (~820 tokens)</text>

      <!-- Center Box: Compitent Coprocessor -->
      <rect x="265" y="20" width="230" height="230" rx="6" fill="var(--surface)" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="1.8" />
      <text x="380" y="48" class="coproc-title" text-anchor="middle">Compitent Coprocessor</text>
      <text x="380" y="64" class="coproc-subtitle" text-anchor="middle">Headless Memory Engine (Rust)</text>

      <!-- Sub-modules of Coprocessor -->
      <rect x="280" y="80" width="200" height="44" rx="3" fill="var(--bg)" stroke="var(--border)" stroke-width="1" />
      <text x="380" y="97" class="module-title" text-anchor="middle">AST Parent-Child Chunker</text>
      <text x="380" y="111" class="module-sub" text-anchor="middle">Zero boundary leakage · pulldown-cmark</text>

      <rect x="280" y="132" width="200" height="44" rx="3" fill="var(--bg)" stroke="var(--border)" stroke-width="1" />
      <text x="380" y="149" class="module-title" text-anchor="middle">Hybrid RRF Index</text>
      <text x="380" y="163" class="module-sub" text-anchor="middle">LanceDB Vectors + Tantivy BM25</text>

      <rect x="280" y="184" width="200" height="44" rx="3" fill="var(--bg)" stroke="var(--border)" stroke-width="1" />
      <text x="380" y="201" class="module-title" text-anchor="middle">Local Stdio MCP Server</text>
      <text x="380" y="215" class="module-sub" text-anchor="middle">Zero telemetry · Offline execution</text>

      <!-- Right Box: Shift-Right Reactive Auditing -->
      <rect x="520" y="55" width="220" height="195" rx="5" fill="none" stroke="var(--border)" stroke-dasharray="4 4" stroke-width="1.2" />
      <text x="535" y="78" class="col-title col-right">Shift-Right: Reactive Auditing</text>
      <text x="535" y="93" class="col-subtitle">Pre-Commit &amp; CI/CD Interceptors</text>

      <rect x="535" y="110" width="190" height="42" rx="4" fill="var(--bg)" stroke="var(--border)" stroke-width="1.2" />
      <text x="630" y="127" class="node-title" text-anchor="middle">Proposed Git Diff</text>
      <text x="630" y="141" class="node-meta" text-anchor="middle">Pre-commit hook or GitHub Action PR</text>

      <line x1="630" y1="152" x2="630" y2="175" stroke="var(--border)" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#arrow)" />

      <rect x="535" y="175" width="190" height="58" rx="4" fill="var(--bg)" stroke="var(--text)" stroke-width="1.5" />
      <text x="630" y="196" class="node-title" text-anchor="middle">Deterministic Boundary Gate</text>
      <text x="630" y="210" class="node-meta" text-anchor="middle">+15.4% adversarial enforcement gain</text>
      <text x="630" y="223" class="node-meta" text-anchor="middle">Blocks rationalized shortcut merge</text>

      <!-- Connecting arrows between coprocessor and stages -->
      <path d="M265 150 L225 150" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="1.8" marker-end="url(#arrow-accent)" />
      <path d="M495 150 L535 150" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="1.8" marker-end="url(#arrow-accent)" />

      <!-- Arrow Markers -->
      <defs>
        <marker id="arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="6" refY="5" markerWidth="6" markerHeight="6" orient="auto-start-reverse">
          <path d="M 0 1 L 8 5 L 0 9 z" fill="var(--border)" />
        </marker>
        <marker id="arrow-accent" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="6" refY="5" markerWidth="6" markerHeight="6" orient="auto-start-reverse">
          <path d="M 0 1 L 8 5 L 0 9 z" fill="var(--accent)" />
        </marker>
      </defs>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <p class="diagram-caption">
    The architectural coprocessor decouples intent indexing from code generation. Shift-left guides IDE models with targeted invariants before typing; shift-right intercepts code diffs at git boundary gates, preventing the "Ammunition Effect" where long prompts rationalize violations.
  </p>
</div>

<style>
  .diagram-container {
    margin: 1.5rem 0 1.25rem 0;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 4px;
    padding: 1.15rem 1.25rem 0.9rem 1.25rem;
    background: var(--surface);
  }

  .diagram-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.65rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.85rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .diagram-badge {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    background: var(--badge-bg);
    color: var(--badge-text);
    padding: 0.15rem 0.45rem;
    border-radius: 3px;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .diagram-title {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 0.98rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .svg-wrapper {
    width: 100%;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .lifecycle-svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
  }

  .col-title {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .col-left {
    fill: var(--accent);
  }

  .col-right {
    fill: var(--text);
  }

  .col-subtitle {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 9.5px;
    fill: var(--muted);
  }

  .coproc-title {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
    fill: var(--text);
  }

  .coproc-subtitle {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 10px;
    fill: var(--accent);
  }

  .module-title {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 10.5px;
    font-weight: 500;
    fill: var(--text);
  }

  .module-sub {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 9px;
    fill: var(--muted);
  }

  .node-title {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 10.5px;
    font-weight: 500;
    fill: var(--text);
  }

  .node-meta {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 9px;
    fill: var(--muted);
  }

  .diagram-caption {
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    line-height: 1.45;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin: 0.75rem 0 0 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .diagram-container {
      padding: 0.85rem 0.75rem;
    }
  }
</style>
